  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you would like translated into zh-TW.\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《災厄入侵》將 Minecraft 中的災厄村民提升到全新境界！近十種擁有獨特能力的新款災厄村民現在遊蕩在你的世界中。有些隱藏在危險的新結構中，有些則加入襲擊村莊的行動，讓戰鬥更加艱難。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">擊敗更聰明的敵人、尋找強力的戰利品，並探索秘密地點。新的挑戰意味著新的獎勵——沿途充滿無限樂趣！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 新型災厄村民</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鍊金術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：擅長射箭的專家，被激怒時會投擲滯留藥水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">書記官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：為附近的災厄村民施加附魔增益。受驚時會逃跑並施放法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">重擊者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：手持盾牌欺負人，會衝向玩家進行撞擊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：遠程攻擊的災厄村民，會投擲致命的戰斧——從他身上取得 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鑲鉑戰斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">挑釁者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用弓箭的災厄村民，擁有基礎增益法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">巫師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：行蹤飄忽的法師，能召喚危險的紫色火焰。掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">異樣塵埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">死靈法師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：不死生物的大師，透過召喚法術壓倒玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">審問者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：擁有強力盾牌的強大戰士——先打破他的盾牌才能擊敗他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">召火者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：看似無害的神秘法師——直到他釋放毀滅性的魔法為止。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">喚魔者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：最強大的災厄村民！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神聖寶珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，用於搭配 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注桌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">升級附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：現已加入生存模式並擁有全新外觀！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術塵埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新建築結構</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">召火者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：帶有農場的小型房屋。產於荒地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">災厄要塞</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：設有圍牆、塔樓與強大災厄村民的防禦前哨站。產於針葉林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術師塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：多層高塔，內部充滿災厄村民，頂部有幻術師戰鬥場景。產於針葉林與深色森林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷宮</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：龐大的地下迷宮，充滿豐富戰利品以及更多災厄村民。留意石廟入口！產於大多數森林生態域。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">巫師小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：小型房屋結構。產於深色森林。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新裝備與物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注桌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：突破常規限制升級附魔！每次使用需消耗一顆 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神聖寶珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鑲鉑戰斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可投擲的斧頭狀武器，由掠奪者稀有掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">遺失的蠟燭</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：透過顯示位置來協助定位附近的礦脈。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">洞察之角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使附近怪物發出光芒，讓你更快發現它們！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器均需安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援配置，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版本需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動配置，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾中，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具體取決於配置類型。並非所有模組都會包含所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 最初開發了精彩的災厄擴充模組（Illager Expansion）。《災厄入侵》忠實延續了他的作品，並加入了大量新功能、改進、重製與錯誤修復。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/ZekeSmith\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在 Dricky 刪除原始碼後重新找到它，使得本移植計畫得以依據 </span><a href=\"https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 授權條款進行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 致力於 Illager Expansion 的 1.19.2 版本，洞察之角的材質即取自該版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了許多精彩的全新材質。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
